@startuml e-state-machine
title E 模块 · 应用生命周期状态机（GamePhase + GameManager）

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #333333
  ArrowColor #333333
  FontSize 13
}

[*] --> MAIN_MENU

MAIN_MENU --> PLAYING : start()\n[有档→load()；无档/损坏→newGame()]
MAIN_MENU --> PLAYING : startNewGame()\n[强制新档，不读档也不写盘]
MAIN_MENU --> EXITING : saveAndExit()\n[state==null → 跳过写盘]

PLAYING --> PAUSED : pause()\n[守卫：仅 PLAYING 可暂停]
PAUSED --> PLAYING : resume()\n[守卫：仅 PAUSED 可恢复]

PLAYING --> EXITING : saveAndExit()\n[save(state) 后退出]
PAUSED --> EXITING : saveAndExit()\n[save(state) 后退出]

PLAYING --> PLAYING : saveNow()\n[仅落盘，不改阶段]
PAUSED --> PAUSED : saveNow()\n[仅落盘，不改阶段]
EXITING --> EXITING : saveAndExit()\n[幂等，不再写盘]

EXITING --> PLAYING : start()\n[无守卫：可被重新拉起]
EXITING --> [*] : MainApplication.stop() → JVM 退出

note right of EXITING
  phase 不落盘：重启必然回到 MAIN_MENU
  设计意图 = 退出后不推进世界（离线模拟属 P2）
end note

note bottom of MAIN_MENU
  非法转移（抛 IllegalStateException，阶段不变）：
  pause()  仅允许从 PLAYING
  resume() 仅允许从 PAUSED
  currentState() / saveNow() 需已 start()（state != null）
  初始态由构造器设置：phase = MAIN_MENU
end note
@enduml
